    req: {"parent_id":"859b7a68-4039-4b49-a936-7dcddcc1dcb6","name":"new top after deleting p1"}
    -> 200 content-type=application/json
    {"item_id": "0ae3bc25-d9ee-44ca-8b73-2d2cc6e02ecd"}
--- DELETE p3 (highest priority)
    DELETE /api/v1/nodes/155f0ec8-dc4f-4012-9a16-b50ef9b975f8
    -> 200 content-type=application/json
    {"status": "ok"}
--- create 'new bottom after deleting p3'
