    req: {"parent_id":"859b7a68-4039-4b49-a936-7dcddcc1dcb6","name":"new bottom after deleting p3","position":"bottom"}
    -> 200 content-type=application/json
    {"item_id": "d1822723-4279-4844-9ea2-ef5dd8c488ee"}
